=3 Notes
* All trolls start out with somewhat reduced HP, between 25% and 75%.
* All trolls are able to use their 2 hour. Due to the fact that they start with reduced HP they will often instantly 2 hour on pull.
* Trolls have naturally low movement speed and thus are very easy to kite.

=2 Walkthrough
Kill all 15 Broken Troll Soldiers to win.
* The {p:Rune of Release} spawns in the north-west of (H-9) at the bottom of the bridge.

